      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey i think i really messed up my back lifting some boxes earlier today. i felt this weird ripping sensation in my mid back and now it's kinda shooting down into my stomach too. it hurts a lot but it's probably just a bad muscle strain right? can i just take some high dose ibuprofen and sleep it off?",
