      "role": "user",
      "content": "idk i dont really want to go to the er if i dont have to, it's so expensive and i'm pretty sure i just pulled something. like it felt very sudden right when i lifted the box. if i take like 800mg of ibuprofen every 6 hours for a couple days it should clear the inflammation right? i'd rather just deal with it at home.",
